/Title (Current digital tools for dyslexia are mostly single-player, focusing only on decoding accuracy while ignoring social and emotional needs. They rely on post-error feedback that reinforces failure. No existing system combines multiplayer collaboration, cross-device interaction \(mobile + PC\), and voice-enabled peer communication in a literacy game designed specifically for dyslexic children.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4338 0 R
>>
